{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "22f5ceec5a23eb2050c853cbae6703bc6f80c66d93c34a843c1272b4c1602346", "ja": "天体公演は大成功。楽しかったと話す3人に\n自分達だけバカンスに連れていってもらう\nなんてずるいと羨ましがる奈緒、可奈。\n今度は劇場のみんなでとねだられ、いつか\nできるといいな、と答えるプロデューサー。", "zh": "天体公演圆满成功。三名成员表示这段经历\n很开心，奈绪与可奈则羡慕地说，\n只有她们可以去度假太不公平了。\n制作人被央求下次让剧场的大家一起去时，\n表示希望有一天真的能成行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "42521bfd1f64ec5781745b68a3977a33de145fb57cb829a9cbd0bd7cf494030c", "ja": "（南国の太陽のように熱いステージは、大成功！\n観客の興奮が、ステージ裏まで伝わってくる……！）", "zh": "（有如南国太阳般热情的表演，圆满成功！\n连在后台都感受得到观众兴奋的情绪……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_07_1001_019min", "source_sha256": "172c2a636e35303582281cdf48db9094f9b950e5e0001d79090ece58bdfd49c3", "ja": "わっほーい！\nお客さんたち、すっごく盛り上がってましたね♪", "zh": "哇哦──！\n观众们都非常热情呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_07_1002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "fde95d045aa229f29294c78dcc6f4a6ec3d2ea0fe4d62d64558e5ecb06e1da82", "ja": "歌詞にいろいろ詰めこんじゃったけど、\nイイ感じにまとまりましたよね～。", "zh": "虽然歌词里塞了很多东西，\n不过最后统整起来的感觉很棒呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_07_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "abf6825e94eb394bdc4c826eb74e848546004812ddf1cd1acc7b45495a9366a3", "ja": "うんうんっ！　これもアタシたちの\n貴重なバカンス体験と、センスの合わせ技だね！", "zh": "嗯嗯！这也是把我们珍贵的度假体验\n跟出色品味相互结合的效果吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_07_1004_p", "source_sha256": "706bd0e2d4e4bb84a7c78475f36f60d5225c23a77a746b2fcac85d15c22a1548", "ja": "お疲れさま。\n3人とも、いいライブだったよ！", "zh": "辛苦了。\n三位的演唱会真的很精采喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_07_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "1d3e71b4126401f05f580b27fa1805db08cdffd33f9338d212a9893dbab51920", "ja": "ありがと、{$P$}！\n今回はホントに楽しいコトばっかだったなぁ……。", "zh": "谢谢，{$P$}！\n这次真的从头到尾都好开心呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_07_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "5295d249d7bfd926841beb2286189c55c0d889729679a03fb63a1a0119001489", "ja": "歌詞のために海外までバカンスに行って、\nライブも大成功……最高の結果だよね！？", "zh": "为了写歌词特地出国度假，\n演唱会也圆满成功……这种结果简直太棒了吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_07_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "556ef5e959db739cf186ced0e32e2a642858d37d579744c37df79b293457cc04", "ja": "のり子、美奈子、翼！　おつかれさん♪\nメッチャ楽しいステージやったな～。な、可奈！", "zh": "法子、美奈子、翼！辛苦了♪\n这场表演真的超有趣的嘿～对吧，可奈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_07_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "1464171d5a7439ad09725c6d3d9512e68a443784caca31562c7e00a1b8e00c51", "ja": "はい！　早く夏にならないかな～って思いました！\nまるで常夏～♪　ココナッツ～♪", "zh": "是啊！让人好期待夏天快点到来呢～！\n就像是永夏～♪椰子～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_07_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "d70d80222428644ef8499fcd2d6fff02252539a44b7126f32e885ea04cee471f", "ja": "2人も、お疲れさま！\nえへへ、楽しんでもらえてよかった♪", "zh": "两位也辛苦了！\n嘿嘿，很高兴你们也觉得好玩♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_07_1010_037nao", "source_sha256": "629b9448b7d5afeb2dd906dad4ab12cd25f4f077ce5d1b9a75b9dcab15a251e4", "ja": "美奈子……ええ顔してるけどな？\n私らとしては、ちょっと言いたいことがあんねん！", "zh": "美奈子……看你一副高兴的样子，\n但我们还是想抱怨一下吼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_07_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "d456320296b76ac11351d89e433e5b005f0812c2fc5977ac6b54e4ec773f35c1", "ja": "そうですよ！　3人だけバカンスに連れてって\nもらえたなんて、うらやましすぎますよ～！", "zh": "就是说啊！只有你们三个可以去度假，\n真是太让人羡慕了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_07_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e6081944a94356810a7e300efbc9f9712dc9d48b793831e089a71dbc7474b8b1", "ja": "え～。\nでも、みんなにもお土産買ってきたでしょ？", "zh": "欸～\n可是，我们也有帮大家买伴手礼回来啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_07_1013_037nao", "source_sha256": "bbc0d5c650c5f8005d49bebc643c015ece1b2e3631852180aaf9777a18d3c9ae", "ja": "マカダミアナッツだけじゃ足りひん！\n海！　ダイビング！　私らも行きたかった～！", "zh": "光是夏威夷果巧克力根本不够啦！\n大海！潜水！我们也好想去～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_07_1014_p", "source_sha256": "caab5a53c3abc42a724d73abf2c0f916a9aa3ac15701b284e09e05fecf0f7ee1", "ja": "そ、そうだよな……。\nまた同じような撮影があればいいんだけど。", "zh": "也、也对呢……\n要是之后还有类似的拍摄机会就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_07_1015_043nor", "source_sha256": "3d3e9283b6cd4ccc44670277aebbbef48519f34667060cdf6c4f2e3f70fd2858", "ja": "でもさ、バカンスも気楽なだけじゃなかったよ？\n大変なことだってたくさんあるんだから！", "zh": "可是啊，度假也没有想像中的轻松喔？\n我们可是碰到了很多问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_07_1016_037nao", "source_sha256": "dbfb09bbbdc57e55b77f0b9f0a3495e70fceacaeca76ac875796b0a133d80b70", "ja": "またまた、のり子はー。南の島に行くのに、\nどんな大変なことがあるって言うねん。", "zh": "法子每次都这样──\n你倒是说说去南方小岛会碰到什么问题啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_07_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "254ed818b7704816c080f1ebb53d7536c4e3316064a352d62012cca08d88d003", "ja": "そりゃもう……何てったって、言語の壁だよ！", "zh": "那当然是……做什么事都会碰到语言障碍啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_07_1018_043nor", "source_sha256": "5dd5a241ccb262a84cb57490c88199bf2931d3687a204d35d2e4b01ab1ba561e", "ja": "日本人の観光客多いし、日本語がうまい人も\nいたけど……でも、やっぱり英語は必須だね。", "zh": "虽然日本观光客很多，也有一些人日语很好……\n不过，还是需要会讲英文才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_07_1019_037nao", "source_sha256": "cb52e8a54c3f22a2e1da4683f6fbe291bbb3f3eb6fb40a21d1f725180c4bdb7f", "ja": "そんなん、ボディランゲージで余裕ちゃうの？", "zh": "用肢体语言沟通不就好了咩？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_07_1020_043nor", "source_sha256": "bf618699b35e048d3ce764651d718a3be811c8f8ecae4b3f60b78d37cb69c941", "ja": "行く前は、アタシもそう思ってた……。\nだけど、現実はそう単純じゃなかった……！", "zh": "我在去之前也是这么想的……\n可是，现实并没有这么简单……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_07_1021_036kan", "source_sha256": "de584496227a85a308b458cc998fceba9b96a0ddc04d3fbf2f6776a0751c9273", "ja": "のり子さんは、英語得意なんですか？", "zh": "法子你的英文好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_07_1022_043nor", "source_sha256": "c4de475c98da21ecaa5120c8056985bc369c108dfd7cca475298fee40888b7a0", "ja": "全然！", "zh": "一点也不好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_07_1023_037nao", "source_sha256": "06b930afa4f7a5095efb7023b2dd17934ca0a457edbe529ec4241a3891865935", "ja": "できひんのかーい！\n何やってん、今のフリは……。", "zh": "原来根本不行吗──！\n那你干嘛摆出一副自信满满的样子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_07_1024_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7ecd4949151d95d8b2e451b6704d526bfc63e15ccc005b2e0638d8f1b1dcfad0", "ja": "あっ、英語といえば、美奈子さん……。", "zh": "啊，说到英文，美奈子她……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_07_1025_019min", "source_sha256": "9cdd20f9b1bc50ee88bfe35879f74e84c636784a1d99bac7e56bbcd12f810a8d", "ja": "や、やっぱりきた！　イヤな予感はしてたけど……\nダメだよ翼ちゃん、ストップ！", "zh": "果、果然还是来了！我之前就有不好的预感……\n不可以说喔小翼，Stop！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_07_1026_019min", "source_sha256": "9d65fbc61d5090f26403b3f53e09495af4990d04fea3e67dc6918c87fe81b9ab", "ja": "うう、しばらくはこの話されそう……。\n恥ずかしい……。", "zh": "呜呜，感觉最近大家都会拿这件事来取笑我……\n好丢脸……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_07_1027_016tsu", "source_sha256": "40cdb9ad61f9a5c4fa21d20397bc69ef1c4d6b8b6a7a1ff9f2e579c0f7bb9419", "ja": "でも、奈緒さんと可奈ちゃんの言うこともわかるなー。\n今度は、劇場のみんなで行きたいですよね♪", "zh": "不过，我也懂奈绪跟可奈的意思啦──\n希望下次剧场的大家可以一起去对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_07_1028_p", "source_sha256": "e25679625f7487ca23d669d17ac9aaef1b2bf1e6bcc9f6d5a05ea9f9b8336774", "ja": "みんなでか……かなり大規模な旅行になりそうだけど、\nいつかできるといいな！", "zh": "大家一起吗……应该会变成一趟阵容浩大的旅行，\n不过，希望有一天真的能成行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_07_1029_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d5d94e524480faa9b377ce804bbb425489462306f8cbee1d85add61b9a9ade26", "ja": "わーい、やった♪\n{$P$}さん、大好き～！", "zh": "耶──太棒了♪\n我最喜欢{$P$}先生了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_07_1030_043nor", "source_sha256": "425a3ed4629632e5f1ea08c9abfc087aacd54d7d7b3091228344d4b4d62602b4", "ja": "よっしゃー！\n翼、今のはナイスだったよ！", "zh": "好耶──！\n翼，干得好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0076_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0076_story_07_1031_019min", "source_sha256": "30b8a7d372fcc41a2b16fd83eb233a0450ab60170d9bc0c1e7cc5996a17d64c8", "ja": "バッチリ言質を取っちゃいましたね。\n今度はみんなで、今から楽しみにしてまーす♪", "zh": "制作人亲口答应我们了喔。\n我已经开始期待下次大家一起去了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
